OL,3,GNEWSADraft law to deal with Troubles
OL,4,Alegacy backed by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegislation aimed at tackling the
OL,7,Flegacy of the Troubles in Northern
OL,8,FIreland has passed its stages in the
OL,9,FHouse of Commons.
OL,11,FThe long-awaited bill was backed by 330
OL,12,FMPs with 178 voting against following
OL,13,Ftwo days of intensive debate over the
OL,14,Fdetails of hundreds of amendments.
OL,16,FIt will now proceed to the House of
OL,17,FLords to face further scrutiny, which
OL,18,Fis expected to continue into next year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
