OL,4,Alegacy backed by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant described the bill as being
OL,8,Fabout "honesty, candour, the pursuit of
OL,9,Fjustice and most importantly truth".
